[II. Box 2: Medium Term Debt Strategy For the FY 2016/17]

After analysing the strategies, S4 was identified as the optimal strategy which entails:

41% outstanding domestic debt and 45% outstanding external debt by end FY2018/19;

The domestic borrowing will be on medium term basis;

External borrowing will comprise of outstanding concessional debt of 23%, 23% on semi concessional terms while 14% will be contracted on commercial terms.
